{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣男星霍建華與太太林心如近日分別為新作展開宣傳，霍建華登上節目大爆拍《如懿傳》的辛酸，甚至自揭入戲太深嚇親太太；</p><p>而身兼演員與製作人的林心如則積極宣傳新作《有愛我們床上談》，戲中的大尺度演出，令她自認年輕10歲都不敢接！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:21:14.708206+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T16:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.957636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.957636+00:00","content_hash":"b21275b8ec1a1a2edf68abdb45f544cabb8ad2c56341ffe5ed266e0a1ed91d1c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}